		(property "Design Note" "Bulk bypass on the unregulated 7-15 V input. X7R is explicit because C7 now shares this exact value string: C7 carried 'X7R' before the consolidation and a review caught that inheriting a bare '10u 25V' would have DROPPED the dielectric from the input bypass of the analog LDO. Package and voltage rating do not imply a dielectric, and Y5V would meet both"
