		(property "Design Note" "Guard-plane isolation resistor on the U4B follower output, feedback taken at the op-amp output exactly as R31 does -- driving a large guard plane is a compensation question, not an afterthought (POTTING.md section 1.3). REPLACES the deleted R22/R23 divider: the guard now tracks the REAL RE electrode instead of an open-loop 0.909 x VREF prediction of it, which is standard guarded-electrometer practice and strictly better guarding. The net name GUARD_REPLICA is kept because repair_guard_fill.py, route_thermal_barrier.py, audit_pcb.py and THERMAL-BARRIER.md all key off it; it is no longer a replica of anything"
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "B.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
