					(size 1 1)
					(thickness 0.15)
				)
				(justify mirror)
			)
		)
		(property "Design Note" "Cathode HF decoupling, deliberately SMALL. AZ431-A Figure 15 (stability boundary vs load capacitance, VKA=VREF curve) shows two stable regions with an unstable band between them; at our ~2.5 mA cathode current (1.67 mA before R41 went 1.5k -> 1k on 2026-09-05; re-read the figure if it moves again, the boundary is current-dependent) the lower stable region runs to roughly 10 nF. 1 n sits well inside it. The bulk capacitance is C10, held OFF the cathode by R31 on purpose -- DO NOT move a microfarad-scale cap onto this node, and do not raise this value, without re-reading that figure. Chart reading, not a specified number: confirm on the bench before release"
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "B.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "41a12e6c-1662-5008-bfe6-e5ddd76e4226")
